<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you, for downloading the "How to Purchase Out Of Area Real Estate Investments" E-Book.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="text-align: left;"><br></div>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="https://c.na45.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153A000003nPgv&amp;oid=00D30000000pfXl" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Inside, you will find incredibly helpful (not to mention, </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">FREE</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">) content aimed at helping you succeed in your passive real estate investment needs.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Our company, <a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/">Memphis Invest</a>, is the largest and most importantly, <b>respected </b>turnkey real estate investment company in the country.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">We have pioneered the passive real estate investment market by helping over 1600 (and counting) investors achieve long term wealth.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Currently, Memphis Invest, has renovated and rented over 4500+ single family properties in 5 of the best performing markets in the country.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Now, we don't claim to be perfect by any means, but we have learned a thing or two since we started a little over 14 years ago.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">You can learn more about our story <a href="https://youtu.be/d5P7wDuBswQ?list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_">here.</a>&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">If you are&nbsp;<b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">ready</b> to get started in building your real estate portfolio, your <i style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">next step</i> is to watch our <b style=""><font color="#3366ff"><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/turnkey/passive-income-jumpstart-package" style="">Quick Start Investors Guide</a>.</font></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">These videos are a great <b>first step</b>&nbsp;to show how Memphis Invest has assisted investors in achieving long term wealth.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Talk Soon,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Marq</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div style=""><span style="font-size: small; font-family: georgia, serif; border-collapse: separate;"><div><span style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></div></span><div style=""><div style="font-size: small;"><img src="https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/P-ZUATG-9KvjtTCYPKyMYZvbZ1icP24mB3AQG8FiodVo-sdJ2JgTowsNbAbkh7l2lFLFbGwo2IeCTAWCabhVQv1K4a8rul-WiunKnoxlWZI0uzWqL8S3lDRln2IqOfbrtqKAikZg-5guzwjsB7ufNvHZ26--Z-xThtVQ2w=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hub/44341/file-2286025665-png/Memphis-Invest-Logo-email-footer.png"><br></div><div style="font-size: small;"><br></div><div style="font-size: small;"><div style="font-family: georgia, serif;"><font color="#000000" face="verdana, sans-serif"><b>Marq Cobb</b></font></div><div style="font-family: georgia, serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><font color="#000000">Memphis Invest</font></span></div></div><div style=""><span style="font-family: georgia, serif; border-collapse: separate;"><font color="#f26522" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">T</font><font color="#000000" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">: +901.481.6842</font></span><br></div><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">F</font><font style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">: +901.201.5803</font></div><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font color="#f26522" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">E</font><font color="#000000" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:brett@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">cobb@memphisinvest.com</a></font><font style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"><br><font style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">http://www.MemphisInvest.com</a></font></font></div><div style="font-size: small; border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
